anBlockPersonally":false,"viewerCanUnblockPersonally":false,"viewerCanPin":false,"viewerCanUnpin":false,"viaApp":null,"minimizedReason":null,"showSpammyBadge":false,"createdViaEmail":false,"authorToRepoOwnerSponsorship":null,"viewerCanReadUserContentEdits":true,"lastEditedAt":null,"lastUserContentEdit":null,"pinnedBy":null,"body":"@roipoussiere, have you considered using this setup?\r\n`--index-url \u003cyour private feed\u003e --extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple`\r\nI believe this would make pip search for a package in your private feed first and then in the public repository.","bodyHTML":"\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e@roipoussiere, have you considered using this setup?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ccode class=\"notranslate\"\u003e--index-url \u0026lt;your private feed\u0026gt; --extra-index-url https://pypi.org/simple\u003c/code\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nI believe this would make pip search for a package in your private feed first and then in the public repository.\u003c/p\u003e","bodyVersion":"6c824a5813e000d8c9d679d102a6b338212e52bf628ec9d197ae172d79155fa3","isHidden":false,"viewerCanUpdate":false,"repository":{"id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNDQ2NDY3","name":"pip","owner":{"__typename":"Organization","id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjY0NzAyNQ==","login":"pypa","url":"https://github.com/pypa"},"isPrivate":false,"viewerCanCreateIssues":false,"slashCommandsEnabled":false,"nameWithOwner":"pypa/pip","databaseId":1446467},"reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","viewerHasReacted":false,"reactors":{"totalCount":2,"nodes":[{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"stephahn0916","name":null,"avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76950079?s=64\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2OTUwMDc5"},{"__typename":"User","__isActor":"User","login":"farhanhubble","name":"farhanhubble","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/761785?s=64\u0026u=6181bb25a8c93d3aafff0f3bacef5b6ca7415709\u0026v=4","__isNode":"User","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MTc4NQ=="}]}},{"content":"THUMBS_